:17: DeprecationWarning: 'audioop' is deprecated and slated for removal in Python 3.13\n    import audioop\n\ntests/test_analysis.py::test_analyze_writes_v2_sidecar_with_skeleton_and_provenance\n  /Users/marekkucharski/projects/.pm-worktrees/vgt/issue-8/.venv/lib/python3.11/site-packages/audioread/rawread.py:19: DeprecationWarning: 'sunau' is deprecated and slated for removal in Python 3.13\n    import sunau\n\n-- Docs: https://docs.pytest.org/en/stable/how-to/capture-warnings.html\n21 passed, 3 warnings in 4.12s\nwarning: `VIRTUAL_ENV=/Users/marekkucharski/projects/proj-mgr/orchestrator/.venv` does not match the project environment path `.venv` and will be ignored; use `--active` to target the active environment instead\nvgt: No .vgt sidecar found at /private/var/folders/pd/78v67x117yd3ly9610zv2yv80000gn/T/tmp.mLrOBZMUAq/Reaper Project/Reaper Project.vgt; run the Phase 0 apply action first.\nTraceback (most recent call last):\n  File \"<stdin>\", line 4, in <module>\n  File \"/Users/marekkucharski/.local/share/uv/python/cpython-3.11.15-macos-aarch64-none/lib/python3.11/json/__init__.py\", line 346, in loads\n    return _default_decoder.decode(s)\n           ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^\n  File \"/Users/marekkucharski/.local/share/uv/python/cpython-3.11.15-macos-aarch64-none/lib/python3.11/json/decoder.py\", line 337, in decode\n    obj, end = self.raw_decode(s, idx=_w(s, 0).end())\n               ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^\n  File \"/Users/marekkucharski/.local/share/uv/python/cpython-3.11.15-macos-aarch64-none/lib/python3.11/json/decoder.py\", line 355, in raw_decode\n    raise JSONDecodeError(\"Expecting value\", s, err.value) from None\njson.decoder.JSONDecodeError: Expecting value: line 1 column 1 (char 0)\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
